# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# PUBLIC PUSH: re-include EXACTLY two things, nothing else.
# These negations come last so they override the extension rules above
# (*.npy / *.faiss / *.json would otherwise still exclude the bank files).
# Scoped to one bank on purpose: a broad `!outputs/` would drag in D10,
# v1, D11 and the code-4 experiment.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
!outputs/reference_index_d10_swap/
!outputs/reference_index_d10_swap/**
!data/questions_demo.json
